## 5. Add authentication

Authentication is crucial to interacting with most APIs. Zapier supports a number of different [authentication schemes](/integrations/build-cli/overview#authentication). In this example, you are going to set it up to include an API Key in a header.

For different types of authentication, see these example apps:

